MFEM optional AmgX/Catch++ modules are disabled. No GPU, MPI, OpenMP, LAPACK, METIS or external sparse solver libraries are enabled. On Linux, lmfluid is dynamically linked to the system glibc (LGPL-2.1, minimum dynamic glibc >= 2.35) and statically links libstdc++, libgcc, and serial MFEM. Windows statically links the MinGW-w64 runtime and GCC runtimes; macOS links only system libraries.
